[
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-001",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "二人の休日に、\n外出したい気持ちと\n家で休みたい気持ちが\n違ったらどう決めたい？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-1-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "一緒に行くなら、海・山・街のどれがいい？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-002",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と食事をするなら、一緒に作るのと外食ではどちらが好き？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-003",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "二人で出かける予定は、前もって決めたい？当日の気分で決めたい？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-004",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と過ごす時間を、写真にどのくらい残したい？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-1-7",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "一緒にいるとき、話す時間とのんびりする時間どっちが好き？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-005",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "二人の記念日は、どんなふうに過ごしたい？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-2-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人にされて嬉しい気づかいは？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-2-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "忙しいとき、恋人にどう接してほしい？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-006",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人と一緒にいて、落ち着いて過ごせるのはどんな時？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-2-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に求める優しさってどんなもの？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-007",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人が自分を理解してくれていると感じるのは、どんな時？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-3-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人にはどこまで本音を言いたい？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-008",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "デートの予定で、相手に合わせることが負担になるのはどんな時？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-3-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "付き合ってから、自分の考え方で変わったところはある？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-3-7",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "2人で大事にしたいルールはある？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-3-8",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人にだけは分かってほしい価値観はある？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-009",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人に気をつかいすぎて、疲れることはある？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-010",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人とのやりとりで、寂しく感じることはある？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-4-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "自分ばかり好きなのかなって不安になることはある？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-4-7",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "付き合っていて、無理している部分はある？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "values-4-8",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "2人の関係で、ちゃんと話し合っておきたいことはある？",
    "category": "values",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-1-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "好きな人と行きたい場所は？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-1-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "好きな人には、言葉で気持ちを伝えたい？態度で伝われば十分？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-1-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "手をつなぐなら、どんなタイミングがいい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-1-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "一緒に食べたい料理は？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-1-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人に言われて嬉しい一言は？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-011",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人には、どんな呼び方をしてもらいたい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-1-8",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "一緒に写真を撮るなら、どんな写真がいい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-026",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "会えない日に、どんなメッセージをもらうとうれしい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-1-11",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と一緒にしたいゲームや遊びは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-012",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と過ごす日常で、幸せを感じる瞬間は？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-1-13",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "デートでされると嬉しいことは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-2-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "好きって言葉はたくさん言われたい？たまにがいい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-013",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に甘える時と甘えられる時、どちらが自分には心地いい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-014",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人とは、どのくらいの頻度で会いたい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-2-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "落ち込んでるとき、恋人にどうしてほしい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-2-7",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に褒められたいところは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-2-8",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人のどんなところにきゅんとする？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-2-10",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "2人だけの約束を作るなら何がいい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-2-12",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人にしてあげたいことは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-3-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "付き合っていて一番大事にしたいことは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-015",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人とのことで不安になった時、どんなふうに気持ちを伝えたい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-016",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人とけんかをしたら、どんなふうに仲直りしたい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-3-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人に直してほしいことがあったら言える？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-017",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人と過ごしやすくするために、自分から変えてみたい習慣はある？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-018",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人と付き合う中でも、変えずに大切にしたい自分らしさは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-019",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人への愛情表現が、お互いの負担にならないために大切なことは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-3-9",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "好きな人にだけ見せる自分ってある？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-3-11",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "これから2人で増やしたい思い出は？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-020",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人に嫉妬した時、その気持ちを伝えられる？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-008",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人が自分以外の友人と親しくしている時、どんな場合に気になる？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-009",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人が自分以外の人と二人で出かけることをどう感じる？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-4-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "浮気ってどこからだと思う？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-021",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人に話すことと、自分だけにしておくことの境目は？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-022",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人同士でも、スマホや個人アカウントで守りたいプライバシーは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-023",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人と会えない日が続く時、どんなやりとりがあると安心する？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-024",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人からの愛情表現が物足りない時、どんなふうに希望を伝えたい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-4-10",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "好きだけど、少し不安になる瞬間はある？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-4-11",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人に「これはやめてほしい」と思うことはある？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-4-13",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "スキンシップで「これは嬉しい」「これはまだ不安」はある？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-025",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人との触れ合いを断りたい時、言いやすくするには何が必要？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-026",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人の誘いを断る時、関係への不安を感じることはある？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-4-18",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "この関係が続くか不安になることはある？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-027",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人への気持ちが変わった時、どんなふうに話し合いたい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-028",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人とすれ違いが増えたら、何から話し合いたい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-4-21",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "ずっと好きでいるために、2人で気をつけたいことは？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "love-4-22",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人の過去は知りたい派？知らなくてもいい派？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-113",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "私たちの気持ちが育つ速さが違う時、どんな付き合い方をしたい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-019",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "過去の恋愛について、どのくらい共有したい？",
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-029",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人の魅力で、今いちばん伝えたいことは？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "other-3-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "今年中に一緒にやりたいことは？",
    "category": "spicy",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-030",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人に応援してほしい自分の目標はある？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-031",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人が一人で抱えているように感じた時、どんな声をかけたい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "other-4-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "今、恋人に一番言ってほしい言葉は？",
    "category": "spicy",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-1-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "ご飯デートとお散歩デート、どっちが好き？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-032",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と映画を見る時、作品はどう選びたい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-033",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "デート中に写真を撮る時、相手にどんな配慮をしてほしい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-034",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "デートの行き先で二人の好みが違ったら、どう決めたい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-2-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "理想のデートは？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-2-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "次に会ったら何したい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-2-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "一緒に見たい景色は？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-2-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "一緒に長く話すならどんな話題がいい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-001",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "一緒に出かける途中で寄り道するなら、どこに行きたい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-002",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "デートの帰りに、二人でどんな時間を過ごしたい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-3-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "一緒に帰るなら何を話したい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-3-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "いつか二人でやってみたいことは？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-3-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "二人でゆっくり過ごすなら何をしたい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-3-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "何も予定がない日、一緒にどう過ごしたい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-4-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "二人だけの思い出として残したいことは？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-4-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人としかしたくないデートは？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-4-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "今までで一番幸せだったデートの瞬間は？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "date-4-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "二人だけの恒例行事を作るなら何がいい？",
    "category": "date",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-035",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と初めて話した時、どんな印象を持った？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-036",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人への印象は、出会った頃からどう変わった？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-1-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "付き合ってから嬉しかったことは？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-1-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "付き合ってからびっくりしたことは？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-1-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "今までのデートで好きだった場面は？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-037",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "二人でしたことの中で、もう一度やってみたいことはある？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-016",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "お互いを意識し始めたきっかけは何？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-2-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "付き合う前、印象に残っている会話は？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-2-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "付き合う前に嬉しかったことは？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-2-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "付き合う前に緊張した瞬間は？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-2-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "付き合う前の自分に言いたいことは？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-3-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "付き合う前に不安だったことは？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-3-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "付き合った日のこと、今どう思っている？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-3-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "付き合う前、私たちが付き合うって予想できた？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-3-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "私たちが付き合う前、告白されるかもって少しでも思ってた？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-038",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "付き合い始めた頃より、二人の距離が縮まったと感じるのはどんな時？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-3-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "付き合ってから変わったことは？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "memories-3-7",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "付き合ってよかったと思う瞬間は？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-039",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人との間で、これから少しずつ知っていきたいことは？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-040",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人がかけてくれた言葉で、印象に残っているものは？",
    "category": "memories",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "affection-1-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "好きって言われるのは嬉しい？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-041",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人とハグする時、先に確かめてほしいことは？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-042",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人に頭をなでられることを、どう感じる？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-043",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人に甘えたい時、自分から伝えるのは得意？苦手？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-044",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に褒められるなら、どんな伝え方がうれしい？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-015",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人として伝えたい、相手がうれしくなる言葉は？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-045",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "寂しい時、恋人にどんなふうに接してほしい？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-046",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "人前で恋人と仲良くする時、どんな距離感が心地いい？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "affection-3-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "二人きりの時だけ甘えたい？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-047",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人と並んで歩く時、どのくらいの距離が心地いい？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-048",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "泣きたい時、恋人にはそばにいてほしい？一人で過ごしたい？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-049",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人からの愛情表現で、少し困るものはある？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "affection-4-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "好きって言われすぎると重く感じる？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "affection-4-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "触れ合いで大事にしてほしいことは？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "affection-4-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人として大切にされていると感じる瞬間は？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-050",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人との距離が近すぎると感じることはある？",
    "category": "affection",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-051",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と話すなら、電話とメッセージのどちらが好き？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-052",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人とは毎日連絡したい？必要な時に連絡したい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-053",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と電話をするなら、どのくらいの長さが心地いい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-054",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人との電話は、眠る前に区切りをつけたい？つないでおきたい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-055",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人にメッセージを送るなら、どんな日常を伝えたい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-056",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人と電話で話すなら、どんな話題が楽しい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-057",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人からの返信が遅い時、不安になることはある？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-058",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人がすぐに返信できない時、どんな伝え方だと安心する？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-059",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人と毎日話すなら、どんな時間に話したい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-060",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "忙しくて連絡を減らしたい時、恋人にどう伝えたい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "contact-distance-2-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "「会いたい」って言うのは得意？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-061",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人と付き合う中で、一人の時間はどのくらい必要？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-062",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人との距離が遠く感じる時、どう気持ちを確かめ合いたい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "contact-distance-3-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "友達との時間と恋人との時間、どっちも大事にできる？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-063",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人との連絡が減ると、気持ちも離れたように感じる？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-064",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人と連絡の頻度や方法が違う時、どうすり合わせたい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-065",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人に寂しさを伝える時、どんな言葉なら話しやすい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-066",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "自分からの連絡が減る時、恋人にどう受け止めてほしい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-067",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "すぐに返信できない日のために、恋人とどんな約束をしておきたい？",
    "category": "contactDistance",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-068",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人に嫉妬することはある？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-021",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人が嫉妬や不安を感じている時、どう伝えてもらえるとうれしい？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-069",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人に気にかけてもらう時、どんな関わり方が心地よい？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-070",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人とのどんなやりとりで、嫉妬を感じることがある？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-071",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人が自分のことに集中している時、自分はどう過ごしたい？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-072",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に心配してもらうことが、負担に感じることはある？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-073",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人への不安を、責めずに伝えるなら何と言いたい？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-011",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "友人との距離感について、恋人と話しておきたいことはある？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "jealousy-3-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "過去の恋愛話はどこまで話していい？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-074",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人の嘘に気づいた時、話し合う前に確かめたいことは？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-013",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人の交友関係について、二人で決めておきたいことはある？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-075",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人からのどんな関わり方を、束縛だと感じる？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-023",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "二人が安心できる距離感と、それぞれの自由をどう両立したい？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "jealousy-4-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人を信じるために必要なことは？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-076",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人とけんかをした時、すぐ話したい？少し時間がほしい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-077",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人との話し合いで怒りが強い時、落ち着くために何をしたい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-078",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人に謝る時、自分の気持ちをどう言葉にしたい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-079",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人に悲しい気持ちを知ってほしい時、どんな合図を出せそう？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-080",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人から相談された時、どんな役割で聞きたい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-081",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人との会話で、避けてもらいたい言い方はある？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-082",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人との冗談で、触れてほしくない話題はある？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-083",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "落ち込んでいる時、恋人にどんな言葉をかけてほしい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-084",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に相談した時、最初にどんな反応があると話しやすい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-085",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人に本音を言えない時、どんなふうに時間をもらいたい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-review-024",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人に、言葉にしにくくても共有したいことはある？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-086",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人に推測で決めつけず、直接聞いてほしいことはある？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-087",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人に変えてほしいことを言われた時、どんな話し方だと受け止めやすい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-088",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人とけんかをした時のために、二人で決めておきたいルールは？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "conflict-support-4-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "好きな人だからこそ言いにくいことはある？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-089",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人と違う本音があっても、安心して話せる関係はどんな関係？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-1-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "理想のカップル像は？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-1-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "周りからどんな二人に見られたい？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-090",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人との間に、どんな安心できる時間を作りたい？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-2-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "付き合う上で一番大事なことは？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-2-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に求める安心感って何？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-091",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人との信頼を育てるために、自分から続けたいことは？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-2-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に一番守ってほしいことは？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-3-1",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "好きだけでは足りないと思うことは？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-3-2",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "長く付き合うために必要な努力は？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-3-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "自分らしくいられる恋愛ってどんな恋愛？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-3-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人同士で成長するってどういうこと？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-092",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人と支え合えていると感じるのは、どんな時？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-093",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人に頼る時も、自分で決めることを大切にするには？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-094",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "二人の将来について、大切にしていきたい約束はある？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-095",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人とこれからもっと知り合うために、どんな時間を持ちたい？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-4-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "好きだけど距離が必要な時はあると思う？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-4-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人にどこまで頼っていいと思う？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "future-values-4-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "二人で乗り越えたいことは？",
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "boundaries-1-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "恋人でも聞かれたくないことはある？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-096",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人と体について話す時、どんな配慮があると安心する？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-097",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人に外見のことを話される時、触れてほしくない話題はある？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-098",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人との会話で苦手な話題になった時、どう切り替えたい？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "boundaries-2-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人でも言っていいことと悪いことの違いは？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-099",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人とハグや手つなぎをする時、大事にしてほしいことは？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "boundaries-3-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人に「今日は無理」って言いやすい？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "boundaries-3-5",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "二人きりの時、どれくらい甘えたい？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-100",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人との触れ合いで、大切にされていると感じるのはどんな時？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-101",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人に「嫌だ」と言われた時、どんな返事をしたい？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "boundaries-4-3",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人同士でも急がなくていいと思うことは？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "boundaries-4-4",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "これからも安心して付き合うために決めたいことは？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-102",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人とペースが違う時、お互いの希望をどう確かめたい？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-103",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "二人が無理せず付き合えているか、どんなふうに確かめ合いたい？",
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "predictions-1-8",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 1,
    "text": "相手が好きそうなデートはどんなデートだと思う？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-104",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人が疲れた時、そばにいてほしいかをどう確かめたい？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-105",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 2,
    "text": "恋人が本音を話しやすいのは、どんな聞き方だと思う？",
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-106",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人がうれしいと感じる愛情表現は、どんなものだと思う？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-107",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人が寂しい時、どんな支え方を望んでいそう？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-108",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人が不安な時、聞くことと励ますことのどちらを望んでいそう？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-109",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人が嫉妬や不安を感じた時、話しやすくするには？",
    "category": "jealousy",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-110",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "恋人は、会えない日が続く時にどんな連絡を望んでいそう？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "predictions-3-7",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "text": "相手は人前で恋人感を出すのは平気だと思う？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-111",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人が二人の時間に安心できるのは、どんな時だと思う？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "predictions-4-6",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "相手が恋人に一番求めていることは何だと思う？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "loves"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-fit-112",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "text": "恋人が自分に大切にされていると感じるのは、どんな時だと思う？",
    "category": "predictions",
    "source": "editorial"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-001",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "別れたいと思ったことはある？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-002",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "相手の悪いところだと感じるのは、どんなところ？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-003",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "相手に言えずに我慢していることはある？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-004",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "category": "reassurance",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "二人の関係で、寂しさを感じるのはどんな時？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-005",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "category": "romance",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "付き合い始めた頃より、気持ちが冷めたと感じることはある？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-006",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "category": "futureValues",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "相手との将来を考える時、迷っていることはある？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-007",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "相手の言動で、まだ心に引っかかっていることはある？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-008",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 4,
    "category": "boundaries",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "相手に合わせるうちに、自分らしさを抑えていると感じることはある？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-009",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "category": "conflictSupport",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "二人の関係で、不公平だと感じる負担はある？"
  },
  {
    "id": "editorial-couples-deep-010",
    "audience": "couples",
    "level": 3,
    "category": "commitment",
    "source": "editorial",
    "text": "これからも付き合うなら、二人の間で変えたいことは？"
  }
]
